<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image7.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.63504in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.22198in;height:0.11561in" /></th>
