<th style="text-align: center;"><strong>Deskripsi</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><strong>Gambar</strong></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;">1</th>
<th>Buka aplikasi Railfinance Masukkan <strong>NIPP</strong> dan <strong>Password</strong>. Lalu klik Button <strong>Login</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image1.png" style="width:3.65306in;height:1.57649in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.15417in;height:0.17222in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.12361in;height:0.16806in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.12373in;height:0.1686in" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;">2</th>
<th>Jika login berhasil Sistem akan menampilkan halaman <strong>dashboard</strong>. Lalu pilih menu <strong>Evaluasi Dokumen Persyaratan Internal,</strong> lalu klik menu <strong>Menunggu Evaluasi</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image88.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.46153in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.20266in;height:0.10399in" /></th>
