<th style="text-align: center;">5</th>
<th>Tampil halaman <strong>Evaluasi Dokumen RAB,</strong> lalu klik <strong>Pilih File</strong> untuk memasukan dokumen RAB baru.</th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image151.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:0.99084in" /><br />
<img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.2049in;height:0.12347in" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;">6</th>
<th>Tampil popup <strong>Dokumen</strong> <strong>Berhasil,</strong> lalu klik button <strong>OK.</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image153.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.61109in" /><br />
<br />
<img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.1953in" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;">7</th>
<th>Tampil data dokumen RAB, periksa kembali data, berikan <strong>Keterangan Revisi</strong> jika dibutuhkan, lalu klik <strong>Submit Evaluasi</strong></th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image171.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.63779in" /><br />
<br />
<img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.13376in;height:0.13654in" /><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="height:0.25978in" /></th>
</tr>
<tr>
<th style="text-align: center;">8</th>
<th>Tampil halaman <strong>Approval,</strong> diatas dokumen <strong>RAB</strong> muncul kata <strong>evaluasi</strong>, yang berarti evaluasi RAB berhasil</th>
<th style="text-align: center;"><img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image130.png" style="width:3.54331in;height:1.64054in" /><br />
<img src="/img/railfinance/anggaran/media/image60.png" style="width:0.20278in" /></th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
</tbody>
</table>

